---
title: "Flexbox and grid"
description: "Tracks, placement, gaps, and alignment."
section: Utilities
sectionOrder: 3
order: 2
---

Grid tracks take a count (`--grid-cols: 3` is three equal tracks) or `subgrid`; a raw track list goes in `--template-cols`. Place with `--col-span`, `--col-start`, `--col-end` and the `--row-*` twins, or write `--col-start: 1; --col-end: -1` to span every track. Inside a layout, `--band: layout-md` places a child in a band.

